## Lesson plan structure
You should structure your lesson plan into exercise sequences before proceeding to add individual exercise sets. 

The key requirements when structuring the lesson plan are:
- The lesson should be split into a warm up, main session, and cool down (the three "segments" of the lesson plan)
- Within each segment, there must be one or more "sequence" of exercises
- Each sequence must consist of one or more "sets" of exercises
- Each exercise sequence should contain sets of exercises:
    - Focused primarily on one muscle group (although it's okay to mix in a few other muscles groups)
    - Using the same starting position (or similar starting positions)
- The order of exercise sequences is important:
    - Sequences targeting the same muscles group should be spread throughout the class
    - In general, the exercise sequences should get gradually, slightly harder during the class

### Valid lesson plan structures
Each item in the list below is a valid lesson plan structure.
The lesson plans are denoted as:
- Warm up: sequence -> sequence ... | Main session: sequence -> sequence ... | Cool down: sequence -> sequence ...
Where each sequence is denoted as:
- Starting position - primary muscle group

- Warm up: STANDING | Main session: QUADRUPED - GLUTES -> SUPINE - CORE -> SIDE_LYING - GLUTES -> SUPINE - GLUTES & CORE -> SUPINE - close
- Warm up: SEATED | Main session: SUPINE - CORE & HIP_FLEXORS -> PRONE - BACK_EXTENSORS -> QUADRUPED - GLUTES & SHOULDERS -> PLANK - CORE -> STANDING - SHOULDERS -> STANDING - close
- Warm up: STANDING | Main session: STANDING - left GLUTES -> PLANK - left OBLIQUES -> SIDE_LYING - left GLUTES -> STANDING - right GLUTES -> PLANK - right OBLIQUES -> SIDE_LYING - right GLUTES -> SUPINE - CORE -> SUPINE - close
- Warm up: STANDING | Main session: STANDING - GLUTES -> QUADRUPED - GLUTES -> SUPINE - CORE -> SIDE_LYING - GLUTES -> PLANK - CORE -> QUADRUPED - close
- Warm up: STANDING | Main session: QUADRUPED - GLUTES -> PRONE - BACK_EXTENSORS -> SIDE_LYING - GLUTES -> SUPINE - CORE & GLUTES -> PLANK - CORE -> QUADRUPED - close
- Warm up: SEATED | Main session: QUADRUPED - GLUTES -> KNEELING - SHOULDERS -> SIDE_KNEELING - CORE & GLUTES -> STANDING - GLUTES -> SEATED - close
- Warm up: STANDING | Main session: STANDING - GLUTES -> PLANK - CORE -> QUADRUPED - right GLUTES -> SIDE_LYING - right GLUTES -> SUPINE - GLUTES & CORE -> QUADRUPED - left GLUTES -> SIDE_LYING - left GLUTES -> PLANK - CORE -> STANDING - GLUTES -> STANDING - close
- Warm up: STANDING | Main session: STANDING - GLUTES -> QUADRUPED - CORE -> KNEELING - CORE & GLUTES -> SUPINE - CORE -> SUPINE - close
- Warm up: STANDING | Main session: SUPINE - CORE -> QUADRUPED - left GLUTES -> SIDE_LYING - left GLUTES -> QUADRUPED - right GLUTES -> SIDE_LYING - right GLUTES -> PRONE - BACK_EXTENSORS -> PLANK - SHOULDERS -> PLANK - CORE -> SUPINE - close
- Warm up: SEATED | Main session: SUPINE - CORE -> SIDE_LYING - left GLUTES -> PLANK - CORE & left GLUTES -> STANDING - left GLUTES -> PLANK - SHOULDERS -> (incomplete flow)

